ion_id":"5fff7c98347d93ce3d2252bac8ca222454e61a1d","body":"### CLA Signature Pass  \n zoujiamin123, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1: ","created_at":"2026-03-10T14:23:48+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-10T14:23:48+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":164786526,"discussion_id":"6fa8805f90633911e0672120f79f72aae7f1bdb1","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-03-10T14:23:52+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-10T14:23:52+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":164786620,"discussion_id":"c2366f270bb784b2661b77fceecd8b14e583d75c","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n修复了MOE（Mixture of Experts）初始化路由V3内核中，针对MXFP8和HIF8量化路径的类型检查条件错误。该错误在特定数据类型组合下，会导致编译器错误地选择或跳过量化操作，从而引发运行时行为异常或编译失败。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n修改了三个`if constexpr`编译期条件判断语句，将原本错误的`DTYPE_X`类型检查更正为`DTYPE_EXPANDED_X`。具体包括：1）在MXFP8量化路径中，修正了`fp8_e5m2_t`类型的检查对象；2）在HIF8 PERTENSOR和PERTOKEN量化路径中，补充了对输出数据类型`DTYPE_EXPANDED_X`必须为`hifloat8_t`的约束。这些修改确保了量化模板仅在输入输出数据类型组合合法时被实例化，避免了潜在的编译和运行时逻辑错误。","created_at":"2026-03-10T14:24:20+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-10T14:24:20+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703"